# Giant Swarm Search MCP Server Environment Configuration
# This file shows example environment variables for the Go implementation

# Note: The current Go implementation uses command-line flags instead of 
# environment variables. See README.md for configuration details.

# Example: Configure transport via environment (if needed for deployment)
# TRANSPORT=stdio
# HTTP_ADDR=:8080
# HTTP_ENDPOINT=/mcp

# Example: Enable debug logging
# DEBUG=true

# Note: Authentication has been temporarily removed from this version.
# It will be reimplemented differently in a future release.
# The server currently accesses only public documentation endpoints.
